        {
          "id": 804496224,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "But does it actually work? The code adding the item is `item = proto_tree_add_item(tree, hf_id, tvb, value_offset, end_offset - value_offset - 2, ENC_ASCII|ENC_NA);` So that's text, not a binary value in that packet, e.g. 32 != \"32\".",
